# NestJS services

- Module layout: `src/modules/<domain>/{controller,service,module,dto}.ts`
- Every external API error uses the standard `{ error: { code, message, trace_id, retryable } }` envelope
- Multi-tenancy: never query without `tenant_id` scope once known
- Webhooks: verify signatures on raw body; consumers must be idempotent
- Prefer constructor injection; keep controllers thin
